{"version":1,"content":"<p>由劉雅麗﹑盧頌恩（妹頭）﹑梁嘉琪﹑張錦霞等主演的舞台喜劇《辦公室劇后》，前天（23日）正式公演，今天（25日）劇團 Why Show Serious宣布，原定於今天下午3時上演之劇目《辦公室劇后》，由於主要演員之一的「妹頭」突發失聲病倒，團方經審慎考慮後，決定將今日下午3時場次延期舉行。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T04:20:31.955513+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":144,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-25T09:33:52+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T11:58:05.264790+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T04:13:25.536855+00:00","content_hash":"d19581d91698131b7b611b6c99f4d500f76ae24084969c833a56f90ab56116b4","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}